sequence (two iterations)\n4. **Termination Conditions**:\n   - Returns factor when GCD is between 1 and `n`\n   - Returns GCD if it equals 
`n` (failure case)\n5. **Efficiency**: Avoids unnecessary computations by:\n   - Using bit-length for random bounds\n   - Early termination 
when factor found\n   - Minimal modular arithmetic operations\n\nThis implementation mirrors the assembly's logic while using Dart idioms 
